  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Spe 103.02 Composition of the Board. Pursuant to RSA 310-A:206, I the board shall consist of 5 members who meet the eligibility requirements of RSA 310-A:206 I-IV.\n\nSource. #13791, eff 10-25-23",
